msgid "Real Hardware for External Users"
msgstr "外部用户的真实硬件"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:21
#: 5fe424a783384d46b11189d018c0e431
msgid ""
"**ARX Lift 2S** is the full-body ARX (方舟无限) mobile manipulator (including"
" chassis). **Acone** / **AC One** is **dual-arm**, not Lift 2S. "
"**HighTorque Panthera HT** (高擎) is a dual-arm manipulator. Prefer the "
"dedicated how-to pages. You don't need internal access for those `open-"
"deploy-ws` branches."
msgstr ""
"**方舟无限 Lift 2S** 是全身移动操作臂（含底盘）。**Acone** / **AC One** 是 **双臂**，不是 Lift "
"2S。**高擎 Panthera HT** 是双臂操作臂。请优先看对应操作指南。使用这些 `open-deploy-ws` 分支不需要内部权限。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:24
#: f174f8452aac4c04843f2440a9d5b0c8
msgid "Day 0: Map the Stack"
msgstr "第 0 天：梳理技术栈"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:26
#: 1a6e81353c0d4e00bab4efc7769ff655
msgid "**Goal:** Understand the ecosystem structure and choose your entry path."
msgstr "**目标：** 理解生态系统结构，并选择你的入口路径。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:28
#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:40
#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:66
#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:126
#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:218
#: 597fff1e668f4f1b984c6c20225d5457 79e32da957d34854a3c25f6b9f800cc3
#: ac5ae5ac91c8425da40960f96e1057a7 cf3ed8bcb57a49ca9529e11f70f762f8
#: e35a30ff89944b029ad1a3c740954257
msgid "**Tasks:**"
msgstr "**任务：**"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:29
#: eb25f0403b3e4a9fbc93d407d5577547
msgid "Read this [Overview](0-index.md) section"
msgstr "阅读本[概述](0-index.md)章节"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:30
#: ff945fb4e90b4747ac266a8a9f8f81a7
msgid "Study the [Architecture](1-architecture.md) diagram"
msgstr "学习[架构](1-architecture.md)图"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:31
#: 4108fb149f8140a5aea1f39f80f31509
msgid "Decide: Public path (`open-deploy-ws`) or Internal path (`fa-deploy-ws`)"
msgstr "做出选择：公开路径（`open-deploy-ws`）或内部路径（`fa-deploy-ws`）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:32
#: becfae2441774d0d92236007ab401e97
msgid "Review the [Repository Map](3-repo_map.md)"
msgstr "查阅[仓库地图](3-repo_map.md)"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:34
#: 154612632ad14b4cbca3fd39156131e2
msgid ""
"**Outcome:** You can explain the five layers and know which workspace to "
"start with."
msgstr "**预期结果：** 你能说明五个层级，并知道该从哪个工作空间开始。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:36
#: c055a013f09544ed91e53d55d570ce34
msgid "Day 1: First Motion in Simulation"
msgstr "第 1 天：仿真中的首次运动"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:38
#: 350748071c9f4e7d9627ea44e55d18c5
msgid ""
"**Goal:** Install the environment, then run a robot demo (`hardware` "
"default `mock_components`)."
msgstr "**目标：** 先安装环境，再运行机器人演示（`hardware` 默认为 `mock_components`）。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:41
#: 55b62427bd674c59b14711e0f0ab01b4
msgid ""
"[Install Environment](../1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md) — "
"Ubuntu 24.04, ROS 2 Jazzy + rosdep. On a bare host: add the ROS apt "
"source, then `ros-jazzy-desktop` / `ros-dev-tools` (fishros is optional)."
" Workspace entry is `./init_repo.sh`, then `source install/setup.bash`."
msgstr ""
"[环境安装](../1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md) — Ubuntu 24.04、ROS "
"2 Jazzy + rosdep。裸机上：先加 ROS apt 源，再装 `ros-jazzy-desktop` / `ros-dev-"
"tools`（fishros 可选）。工作区入口是 `./init_repo.sh`，然后 `source "
"install/setup.bash`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:42
#: 748bd1ae8f474851964ace7cab26a508
msgid "Clone `open-deploy-ws` and run the official init script:"
msgstr "克隆 `open-deploy-ws` 并运行官方初始化脚本："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:43
#: 3a35c570145a4e24b2a2c166c9529b6d
msgid ""
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws.git\n"
"cd open-deploy-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh\n"
msgstr ""
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws.git\n"
"cd open-deploy-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:48
#: 85ef9f002bce494ebe9a5d07527834a6
msgid "Build the workspace:"
msgstr "编译工作空间："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:49
#: 8810794473984103a028b5502c32f04e
msgid "colcon build --symlink-install\n"
msgstr "colcon build --symlink-install\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:52
#: 1729f1a8d79f41499c6c124f6798f8b1
msgid ""
"Launch the demo (defaults: `robot:=cr5`, `hardware:=mock_components` — "
"omit both; there is no `hardware:=mock`):"
msgstr ""
"启动演示（默认：`robot:=cr5`、`hardware:=mock_components` — 两者都可省略；没有 "
"`hardware:=mock`）："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:53
#: d4ff262af9a7408c96109790337f641a
msgid ""
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py\n"
msgstr ""
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:58
#: b13539f21ef04250bf80750d1a7c80b0
msgid ""
"**Primary sources:** [open-deploy-ws](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/open-deploy-ws), [arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control)"
msgstr ""
"**主要来源：** [open-deploy-ws](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-"
"ws)、[arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control)"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:60
#: 0c18c8eb5cdf4b00831415e8de80948b
msgid ""
"**Outcome:** RViz opens with the OCS2 demo; FSM starts in HOLD. See "
"[Quick Demo](../1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md)."
msgstr ""
"**结果：** RViz 打开 OCS2 演示；FSM 从 HOLD 开始。见 "
"[快速演示](../1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md)。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:62
#: a9c9ec6425224d6b8f10362b3ec04448
msgid "Day 2: Switch Robots"
msgstr "第 2 天：切换机器人"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:64
#: 783447721bef439d8d30765a202d5130
msgid "**Goal:** Change the robot model and understand the description system."
msgstr "**目标：** 更换机器人模型，并理解描述系统。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:67
#: 87e1a039268a40798f8a8f5bf3aefb2c
msgid ""
"Prefer `./init_repo.sh` so nested modules under `src/robot-descriptions/`"
" match `submodules_visibility.conf` (do not recursive-init)."
msgstr ""
"优先用 `./init_repo.sh`，让 `src/robot-descriptions/` 下的嵌套模块与 "
"`submodules_visibility.conf` 一致（不要递归 init）。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:68
#: 09ed8fd469154df0a9a873cbed21faad
msgid "Rebuild the packages you need, then `source install/setup.bash`."
msgstr "重建所需软件包，然后 `source install/setup.bash`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:69
#: df8468bad7814c2283102de291e3c758
msgid "Launch with the new robot (omit `hardware:=` to keep `mock_components`):"
msgstr "用新机器人启动（省略 `hardware:=` 以保持 `mock_components`）："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:70
#: c016f878064e431384d309eae6820323
msgid "ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=arx_acone\n"
msgstr "ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=arx_acone\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:73
#: ae48c604d5ea40a8933cbd0d8928ff5e
msgid ""
"`arx_acone` is **Acone** (dual-arm), not Lift 2S. Full-body ARX Lift 2S "
"uses the `arx-lift2s` branch scripts — see [ARX Lift "
"2S](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md)."
msgstr ""
"`arx_acone` 是 **Acone**（双臂），不是 Lift 2S。全身方舟无限 Lift 2S 使用 `arx-lift2s` "
"分支脚本 — 见 [方舟无限 Lift "
"2S](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md)。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:75
#: 83077712d8674e4294461f4d284370f9
msgid ""
"**Primary sources:** [robot_descriptions](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions), brand-specific READMEs"
msgstr ""
"**主要来源：** [robot_descriptions](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions)、各品牌 README"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:77
#: ae9a7aa98cd448b999bdddd2331c95a8
msgid ""
"**Outcome:** You can switch between Dobot CR5, Acone (dual-arm), Galbot, "
"etc."
msgstr "**预期结果：** 你可以在 Dobot CR5、Acone（双臂）、Galbot 等机型之间切换。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:79
#: 5e9f462d07ff4408883a8b99f3be8c5b
msgid "Day 3: Gazebo and Isaac Simulation"
msgstr "第 3 天：Gazebo 与 Isaac 仿真"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:81
#: f89890f197c2446ba1ba937ed3c3d83d
msgid "**Goal:** Run physics simulation instead of mock hardware."
msgstr "**目标：** 运行物理仿真，而不是 mock 硬件。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:83
#: eb0c730730274a4989007e77472e24db
msgid "Gazebo Harmonic"
msgstr "Gazebo Harmonic"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:85
#: da78e53909c04070bf17eee7dc7e8358
msgid ""
"# Install Gazebo packages (if not already)\n"
"sudo apt install ros-jazzy-gz-*\n"
"\n"
"# Launch with Gazebo\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py hardware:=gz\n"
msgstr ""
"# Install Gazebo packages (if not already)\n"
"sudo apt install ros-jazzy-gz-*\n"
"\n"
"# Launch with Gazebo\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py hardware:=gz\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:93
#: 94617717d1d3471cb4754ee11ae2149f
msgid "Isaac Sim (FaSim)"
msgstr "Isaac Sim（FaSim）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:95
#: ac9d480bc7de469ca1e298e33a5d6346
msgid ""
"**FaSim** pairs NVIDIA Isaac Sim high-fidelity simulation with the same "
"ROS 2 运控 stack as the real robot, so motion matches hardware while the "
"sim supplies ground truth. Assets: [FaSim-Isaac](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac) (one-click USD + scene pull), "
"[robot_usds](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_usds)."
msgstr ""
"**FaSim** 把 NVIDIA Isaac Sim 高保真仿真与真机同一套 ROS 2 运控叠在一起：运动能力对齐硬件，仿真再提供真值。资产"
"：[FaSim-Isaac](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac)（一键拉取 USD "
"与场景）、[robot_usds](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_usds)。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:97
#: a5ea0b361eb540299f7b83a5904692fb
msgid "FaSim-Isaac scripts"
msgstr "FaSim-Isaac 脚本"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:100
#: 20ab5965d8f84fe3ba5a05f9f0fbd430
msgid ""
"Use **FaSim-Isaac** `./init.sh` then `./run.sh`. Default Isaac path is "
"`ISAACSIM_DIR` (`~/isaacsim`); override in `config/fa_sim.local.conf`. "
"Version for the optional ROS 2 workspace comes from the init menu "
"(fallback list in `config/fa_sim.conf`), not a hardcoded minor version in"
" these docs."
msgstr ""
"使用 **FaSim-Isaac** 的 `./init.sh`，再运行 `./run.sh`。默认 Isaac 路径是 "
"`ISAACSIM_DIR`（`~/isaacsim`）；在 `config/fa_sim.local.conf` 中覆盖。可选 ROS 2 "
"工作空间的版本来自 init 菜单（回退列表见 `config/fa_sim.conf`），不要在文档里写死某个次版本号。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:103
#: 01573890b72a4ddfb878bf1d4b0c7bde
msgid ""
"Install NVIDIA Isaac Sim (default directory `~/isaacsim`, or set "
"`ISAACSIM_DIR`)."
msgstr "安装 NVIDIA Isaac Sim（默认目录 `~/isaacsim`，或设置 `ISAACSIM_DIR`）。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:104
#: f7c322b6e77c4954af457e2604a4451a
msgid "Clone and initialize FaSim-Isaac:"
msgstr "克隆并初始化 FaSim-Isaac："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:105
#: df01b3856a864f41b6a7aeae3f485904
msgid ""
"git clone git@github.com:fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac.git\n"
"cd FaSim-Isaac\n"
"./init.sh\n"
msgstr ""
"git clone git@github.com:fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac.git\n"
"cd FaSim-Isaac\n"
"./init.sh\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:110
#: 16b90d29839a4cb28ecf8aa0fc625988
msgid "Start Isaac (`./run.sh` menu: PhysX / Newton / Headless Streaming):"
msgstr "启动 Isaac（`./run.sh` 菜单：PhysX / Newton / Headless Streaming）："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:111
#: 7b4352ba5b5740ea8cc8035effdc3650
msgid "./run.sh\n"
msgstr "./run.sh\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:114
#: a9fbd5aad4344941be83cce420c96de3
msgid ""
"Connect ROS 2 using **one** of the two Isaac paths in [Isaac "
"Sim](../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md):"
msgstr ""
"用下面两条 Isaac 路径中的一条连接 ROS 2，说明见 [Isaac "
"Sim](../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md)："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:115
#: 6aa26adcf4424ba59dac702af4a517c7
msgid ""
"Topic bridge, from the workspace terminal: `ros2 launch "
"ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py hardware:=isaac`"
msgstr ""
"话题桥，在工作空间终端执行：`ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py "
"hardware:=isaac`"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:116
#: 04fa3a29f1cc46998b4cb9b1c42f746d
msgid ""
"In-process: open a USD whose ROS payload contains `ROS2ControlLaunch` and"
" press Play. That path sets `hardware=isaac_sim` inside Isaac. It is not "
"a second `hardware:=` on `demo.launch.py`."
msgstr ""
"进程内：打开 ROS 载荷里含有 `ROS2ControlLaunch` 的 USD 并播放。这条路径在 Isaac 内部设置 "
"`hardware=isaac_sim`。它不是 `demo.launch.py` 上的第二个 `hardware:=`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:118
#: bf8f87ba461b42569de9d420bc74d6fa
msgid ""
"**Primary sources:** [FaSim-Isaac](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac), [robot_usds](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_usds)"
msgstr ""
"**主要来源：** [FaSim-Isaac](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac)、[robot_usds](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_usds)"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:120
#: 91a4682296e746b99f5fec1b318bb7ed
msgid ""
"**Outcome:** Physics-based simulation with Gazebo, or FaSim (Isaac + ROS "
