"步骤和文件布局：[添加机器人](../2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md)。Isaac "
"启动和两种连接：[Isaac Sim](../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md)。机制：[FaSim-"
