"[`simulation_hardware.xacro`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/xacro/ros2_control/simulation_hardware.xacro)。`ros2"
" launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=<key>`（省略 "
"`hardware:=`）应在打开 Isaac 之前进入 HOLD。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:237
#: 4c640ef67d5c4bdf80b90a5e59b4077d
msgid ""
"**USD.** A stage `./run.sh` can open, with one ArticulationRoot for this "
"robot, under [robot_usds](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_usds) or "
"a project scene you can access. There is no `./run.sh --robot`."
msgstr ""
"**USD。** `./run.sh` 能打开的舞台，且这款机器人有一个 ArticulationRoot，放在 "
"[robot_usds](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_usds) "
"或你有权限的项目场景里。启动方式是打开 USD，而不是 `./run.sh --robot`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:238
#: 5817667b8ec24716817910653371b451
msgid "**One sim connection** for those joints."
msgstr "**这些关节只用一种仿真连接。**"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:239
#: 4f301263c6974adbaf7c1030be00cb52
msgid ""
"**Topic bridge:** `hardware:=isaac` → `TopicBasedSystem`. The xacro "
"`joint_commands_topic` / `joint_states_topic` equal that graph’s "
"`topicName`. The shared macro writes `/isaac/joint_command` and "
"`/isaac/joint_states`. A robot graph may use other names (W2 topic-bridge"
" payload: `/joint_command` and `/joint_states`). `demo.launch.py` has no "
"namespace argument."
msgstr ""
"**话题桥：** `hardware:=isaac` → `TopicBasedSystem`。xacro 里的 "
"`joint_commands_topic` / `joint_states_topic` 必须等于该图的 `topicName`。共享宏写入 "
"`/isaac/joint_command` 和 `/isaac/joint_states`。某台机器人的图可能用别的名字（W2 话题桥载荷是 "
"`/joint_command` 和 `/joint_states`）。`demo.launch.py` 没有命名空间参数。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:240
#: 9f36513836e24ad2b34ecc4588f669d5
msgid ""
"**In-process:** Play a payload that contains `ROS2ControlLaunch` (W2: "
"[`fiveages.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fiveages-gen2-robot-"
"usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/fiveages.usda)). The node sets "
"`hardware=isaac_sim` and `isaac_prim_path`. The description xacro must "
"accept `isaac_sim`."
msgstr ""
"**进程内：** 播放含 `ROS2ControlLaunch` "
"的载荷（W2：[`fiveages.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fiveages-gen2"
"-robot-usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/fiveages.usda)）。节点会设置 "
"`hardware=isaac_sim` 和 `isaac_prim_path`。描述 xacro 必须接受 `isaac_sim`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:241
#: 08f093d4481644c7a0b16e6749594309
msgid ""
"**Controllers.** Arm or split body: `ocs2_arm_controller` (`demo` or "
"`split_body`). Whole body only when this robot’s planner model includes "
"the mobile base: `full_body.launch.py` and, with access, [ocs2-wbc-"
"controller](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/ocs2-wbc-controller). Leave "
"`infoFile` empty to keep the description default. To lock a mobile base, "
"use `mobile_base_tcp` and `BASE_LOCK`. `full_body` together with a "
"`fixed_base` info file has no virtual chassis joint for that lock, and "
"arm enable can stay waiting."
msgstr ""
"**控制器。** 机械臂或分体：`ocs2_arm_controller`（`demo` 或 "
"`split_body`）。只有规划模型包含移动底盘时才做全身：`full_body.launch.py`，以及有权限时的 [ocs2-wbc-"
"controller](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/ocs2-wbc-"
"controller)。`infoFile` 留空则用描述包默认值。要锁住移动底盘，用 `mobile_base_tcp` 和 "
"`BASE_LOCK`。`full_body` 再配一份 `fixed_base` 的 info "
"时，这次锁定没有虚拟底盘关节，手臂使能会一直等待。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:242
#: 664bc4a0d4724e42965c8638b00c8feb
msgid ""
"**Motion you can see.** A small FSM home or joint target changes the same"
" joints in Isaac."
msgstr "**能看见的运动。** 一次小的 FSM 回零或关节目标，会让 Isaac 里同一批关节动起来。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:244
#: 4a096772ea7d480bb5f33460e6ea1a3b
msgid "Only if this robot has it"
msgstr "仅当这款机器人具备时"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:196
#: c4cc94b953da4e8a94ff9c3859a83e25
msgid "Piece"
msgstr "Piece"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:196
#: d61a7b785c6f45b18cc596170d160fe1
msgid "When"
msgstr "When"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:196
#: 25d6c4437d0547a9bdf018a921004e97
msgid "What to wire"
msgstr "要接上什么"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:196
#: 77211c0759b3490ab3d9a7d6bfb92e60
msgid "Chassis / odom"
msgstr "底盘 / 里程计"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:196
#: dacc4014514e4a99a9b1b6598541e179
msgid "It has a mobile base"
msgstr "有移动底盘"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:196
#: 92e2e9671f7f46d8a9a15f4b01fa4ad1
msgid ""
"Isaac publishes `world → odom → base_*`. `robot_state_publisher` "
"publishes the URDF tree (`base_footprint → base_link` when both exist). "
"OCS2 `baseFrame` is that same link. One publisher per TF edge. A ROS "
"namespace does not rename `frame_id`."
msgstr ""
"Isaac 发布 `world → odom → base_*`。`robot_state_publisher` 发布 URDF "
"树（两边都有时包括 `base_footprint → base_link`）。OCS2 的 `baseFrame` 就是这同一个连杆。每条 TF"
" 边只有一个发布者。ROS 命名空间不会改写 `frame_id`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:196
#: 5ce8e6e5d00948c880fb9e17b147bdb9
msgid "Gripper or hand"
msgstr "夹爪或手"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:196
#: 4f3e80258f3943399564662f69615518
msgid "It has one"
msgstr "这款机器人有一个"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:196
#: 53905533b9564177a59f1fde4362eac5
msgid "Launch `type` / `left_type` / `right_type`. There is no `gripper:=`."
msgstr "Launch `type` / `left_type` / `right_type`. There is no `gripper:=`."

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:196
#: 184d02a0c37b4ca2b8f2303106576be7
msgid "Navigation"
msgstr "Navigation"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:196
#: b8ea3061f87f41faaa40cf76ec0ac63a
msgid "The scene drives the base on a map"
msgstr "场景要让底盘按地图行驶"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:196
#: 71ea1b0b2aee4ff38553209e7290a61c
msgid ""
"`NavigationLaunch` on the USD. `map` is a path relative to the opened "
"`env/` layer. It starts `navigation_isaac_gt.launch.py`. Composer "
"`ros2-stack` is a separate host process."
msgstr ""
"USD 上的 `NavigationLaunch`。`map` 是相对已打开 `env/` 层的路径。它启动 "
"`navigation_isaac_gt.launch.py`。编排器的 `ros2-stack` 是另一个宿主机进程。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:196
#: 34c56748733f40b48624861d680fabbd
msgid "Second robot"
msgstr "第二台机器人"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:196
#: 81ad0fc480e740cb9089fd3ac3b21dd5
msgid "Two articulations in one stage"
msgstr "同一舞台里有两个关节体"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:196
#: 717ac2977e3e45a3b76f05e00aa4bb19
msgid ""
"Each root has its own graph and `ROS2ControlLaunch` `namespace`. Topics "
"live under `/<ns>/`. Frame names stay `world`, `odom`, `base_link`."
msgstr ""
"每个根有自己的图和 `ROS2ControlLaunch` 的 `namespace`。话题在 `/<ns>/` 下。帧名仍是 "
"`world`、`odom`、`base_link`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:253
#: e7a018c35d0f4c478c3bc370dd6b1668
msgid "Phases"
msgstr "Phases"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:255
#: 9ca0d9ad79ec40b1ab87b14bbf3bd0dc
msgid "Mock: the demo launch above, FSM HOLD, joint names from the xacro."
msgstr "Mock：上面的演示启动，FSM 停在 HOLD，关节名来自 xacro。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:256
#: e471bdf2277b4e40b3c08e5b7b271ca3
msgid "`./run.sh`, open your USD, Play runs physics."
msgstr "`./run.sh`，打开你的 USD，播放后物理在跑。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:257
#: da3f1b3fb5334a1c885bdea7894f8936
msgid ""
"Topic bridge **or** in-process graph. `ros2 topic echo` the joint-state "
"topic, or `ros2 control list_controllers`."
msgstr ""
"话题桥**或**进程内图。对关节状态话题做 `ros2 topic echo`，或执行 `ros2 control "
"list_controllers`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:258
#: 19bd634df45942d2a25479c591a288c4
msgid ""
"Command a small motion. The sim joints move. On the in-process graph, "
"`ros2 topic hz /clock` tracks the physics step."
msgstr "发一个小运动。仿真关节会动。进程内图上，`ros2 topic hz /clock` 跟着物理步走。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:260
#: dd217448cfdd4fcbbc0c8ec920e45ba7
msgid "What you hand in"
msgstr "要交什么"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:262
#: e7e45de1031249daaf44cc0d09327bea
msgid "The description package (or branch) and the USD path you opened."
msgstr "描述包（或分支），以及你打开的 USD 路径。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:263
#: a6b83566fb7444edbb19a6044cacbc6a
msgid "The launch line **or** the `ROS2ControlLaunch` prim you played."
msgstr "启动命令行，**或**你播放的 `ROS2ControlLaunch` 图元。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:264
#: 80628069538945d0ae80776fbd3b996b
msgid ""
"The joint-state topic or controller list you saw, and the motion you "
"commanded."
msgstr "你看到的关节状态话题或控制器列表，以及你下发的运动。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:266
#: b47515e587b84409ba544f0b8a7536ec
msgid "Pass when you can show"
msgstr "能演示这些就通过"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:268
#: 0e06963efbfc4c5aa09d3bf24fabc9f5
msgid "Mock HOLD, then sim Play, on **this** robot."
msgstr "先 mock 到 HOLD，再仿真播放，对象是**这款**机器人。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:269
#: ec1c79d2d79e4aa7b14037444c6e28bb
msgid ""
"Joint state or the controller state interfaces match the xacro joint "
"names."
msgstr "关节状态或控制器状态接口与 xacro 关节名一致。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:270
#: 3e8961712cec48f68911bc4984cd4761
msgid "A command moves those joints in Isaac."
msgstr "一条指令让这些关节在 Isaac 里动起来。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:271
#: b2653b9e233842f3a1552850435a9696
msgid ""
"If the payload publishes odometry: `world → odom → base_*` from Isaac, "
"URDF tree from `robot_state_publisher`, and no second node on the same "
"edge."
msgstr ""
"若载荷发布里程计：`world → odom → base_*` 来自 Isaac，URDF 树来自 "
"`robot_state_publisher`，同一条边没有第二个节点。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:272
#: 1354bd31e7844908922cfc195552a619
msgid ""
"In-process: `/robot_description` comes from `robot_state_publisher`. The "
"controller manager is started with robot-description publishing off."
msgstr "进程内：`/robot_description` 来自 `robot_state_publisher`。控制器管理器启动时关闭了机器人描述发布。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:274
#: f1ba326bc1344b6d9af2a3c503934306
msgid ""
"A motion that finishes too fast is a `/clock` problem (physics-step clock"
" versus playback tick). The FaSim reference describes that clock. It is "
"not fixed by editing joint gains."
msgstr "运动结束得过快，是 `/clock` 的问题（物理步时钟相对播放节拍）。FaSim 参考页说明了这套时钟。改关节增益解决不了。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:276
#: 1026d30fe8ce4605b075e43c02fcb51a
msgid "Optional: Synthetic data (Isaac)"
msgstr "可选：合成数据（Isaac）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:278
#: ff04abb6c3744d8480604599a7c9d542
msgid ""
"**Goal:** Understand the Isaac datagen path (not Gazebo): USD scene → "
"`ROS2RobotInterface` → composer `task_queue` → LeRobot dataset on disk."
msgstr ""
"**目标：** 弄清 Isaac 数据采集路径（不是 Gazebo）：USD 场景 → `ROS2RobotInterface` → "
"composer `task_queue` → 磁盘上的 LeRobot 数据集。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:280
#: abdb2861ed33444eae92bd2e31643e1e
msgid ""
"Follow [Synthetic Data](../2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/0-index.md) on "
"[lerobot_ros2](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/lerobot_ros2) `main` and "
"[robot_action_composer](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_action_composer) `main`. Stop at recording/export; skip "
"training."
msgstr ""
"按 [合成数据](../2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/0-index.md) 走 "
"[lerobot_ros2](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/lerobot_ros2) 的 `main` 和 "
"[robot_action_composer](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_action_composer) 的 `main`。停在录制 / 导出，跳过训练。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:282
#: a6b8a4d8a77d4cd894284eb3d8416443
msgid "After the beginner path"
msgstr "新手路径之后"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:284
#: 6b5d253de1b942bab0ddc008493220ae
msgid ""
"Continue by **role** in [More "
"applications](../6-more_applications/0-index.md): field commissioning "
"(现场调试), classical algorithm (传统方案算法工程师), VLA collect / train / deploy "
"(VLA 采训推), simulation (仿真工程师)."
msgstr ""
"按 **角色** 继续看[更多应用](../6-more_applications/0-index.md)：现场调试、传统方案算法工程师、VLA "
"采训推、仿真工程师。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:286
#: 7ae5f8b5000f4124b83437e763d9b223
msgid "Tips for Success"
msgstr "实用建议"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:288
#: 84245dc734e34ea59f2326c05078fe77
msgid ""
"**Don't skip mock mode** — Always verify behavior in mock before "
"simulation or real hardware"
msgstr "**不要跳过 mock 模式** — 在进入仿真或真实硬件之前，务必先在 mock 中验证行为"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:289
#: 4367a0d7b8b24a678c90a3a0bb250c9b
msgid ""
"**Read the warnings** — The stack logs helpful messages about "
"configuration issues"
msgstr "**阅读警告信息** — 技术栈会记录有助于排查配置问题的日志"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:290
#: 8ee96f8c22d944f696fb6e69afb460b6
msgid ""
"**Use lean branches** — `open-deploy-ws` offers `dobot-cr5`, `arx-"
"lift2s`, and `panthera-ht`"
msgstr "**使用精简分支** — `open-deploy-ws` 提供 `dobot-cr5`、`arx-lift2s` 和 `panthera-ht`"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:291
#: 678e88e7bb474d4593fbfadbc985ec19
msgid ""
"**Ask questions** — File issues on the relevant repository for bugs or "
"unclear documentation"
msgstr "**提出问题** — 遇到缺陷或文档不清时，请在相应仓库提交 issue"

